---
import headshot from "../assets/headshot.jpg";
---

<section class="about-me-section">
	<h1>About me</h1>
	<div class="about-me-body">
		<figure class="about-me-headshot">
			<img src={headshot.src} alt="Headshot of Alasdair McCall" />
		</figure>
		<p>
			Mobile engineering leader with two decades of experience building
			iOS and Android products and leading teams. I hire and develop
			engineers, support engineering managers, and help teams improve
			delivery, combining hands-on technical experience with strong
			product and commercial judgement.
		</p>
		<p>
			Previously Head of Mobile at Travelex and Markor, I now work
			through Mindera on engineering leadership and team development,
			including practical AI adoption.
		</p>
		<p>
			Outside work, I am building Garnish, a personal podcast app, to
			deepen my understanding of full-stack development and the latest AI
			technologies.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
